<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:33:54 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">James</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thơ Ja-kơ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ja-kơ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jas</para>
  <para style="mt">Ja-kơ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Ja-kơ, dhơn ratơơq ưng Yaang Pleng lơq ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, pagơơi đóng majêt bơơr dhong nooi kalóóng xók talum tachêh tavươk: Nhan chap yayar adhi anó kalóóng bhuui marhaal. <verse eid="JAS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Nhan móón adhi anó ưng aku, xók adhi anó n'tôq leq dyóp rau klêêu lêi, phaai lêi ađek nek lóóm marhaal bing dyóp, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />taai n'nal kơi rau klêêu lêi lóóm huuiq adhi anó yuur avaaih praan karơ đơơp jruôn. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Bơơi, praan karơ đơơp jruôn phaai tabhlơng lơh liêm dyóp praan karơ, đóng adhi anó ve chóóm bâân tadhơ gamak lơq xong bhơt, yươq dyơq rau tabhuch. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Hayơq la ngaai ađek kalóóng adhi anó thiêuq tabech galang, manưih achêk phaai gavơh nhan tââq Yaang Pleng, Yaang đóng chok leq kơi xưa bhlaai đóng dyóp ngaai manưih hơq kah trêh teng, nek rau tabech galang e bâân đóng leq manưih achêk. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Bơơi manưih achêk phaai gavơh nhan kalóóng lóóm huuiq, kah rau paangra, taai manưih paangra dhiêp kơi ga-uul taxiiq, bâân kajêêq đââng lơq dyók dhaluônh toom adhiiq. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Manưih kơi ađek óóq rââm kơi ađêi e bâân đơơp ve rau tââq Chuôq, <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />hơq nek manưih buôn paangra, kah mưng karnóq kalóóng dyóp kalơng katôôch ađêi. <verse eid="JAS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Manưih adhi anó kalóóng dhiq ngeeo katui phaai pajơơr leq tanơơt yaal charnap ưng ađêi, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />hayơq manưih kavaan phaai pajơơr leq rau katưưiq katit ưng ađêi, taai manưih achêk e bil tich kơi pô raring dhiq klung bhơơi. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Mat tangêi yuur blo palơq puih parđiêq óch róh lơq têêng arang vet bhơơi n'lóóng, pô ađó ruuh n'tôq, hót nguôi liêm kra ưng ađó gluui bil. Makơi ađek, manưih kavaan kung e bâân rang vet m'pơng tarnêêng parvôôiq viêng tapun ưng ađêi. <verse eid="JAS 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Phươk đóng manưih đơơp klêêu lêi. Taai, xók ơi bâân lêi đuôh jruôn, manưih achêk e đơơp dhanưưk rau mamông, nek rau đu Yaang Pleng ơi hươq đóng leq nôôq ngaai nh'nhơr Ađó. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Xók bâân dharơơl galơơk, óóq ve ngaai móón kơi ađô: “Aku bâân Yaang Pleng dharơơl galơơk.” Taai Yaang Pleng nek kah chóóm bâân rau aak dharơơl galơơk, hơq chênh Ađó kung kah dharơơl galơơk ngaai. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Bơơi ting chanak manưih bâân dharơơl galơơk, xók bâân pajươk kajôông lơq chut dharơơl tââq lóóm malóóch ưng chênh ađêi kala. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Tââq ađek, lơh xók ơi achak kadhaap, malóóch kiêng avaaih matu lơt, hơq xong xók ơi bâân ban gamak matu lơt avaaih akan chêt. <verse eid="JAS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Nhan móón adhi anó bơk nh'nhơr ưng aku, óóq đóng ađêi bâân galơơk chachââr. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Dyóp rau chrooi đóng liêm kre lơq dyóp kliim kaliim bhơt liêm maar bhral tư tââq yaal, nek bhral tââq Ama ưng rau brương, hơq kalóóng Ađó kah ve rau tadhơ môôiq a-ô tadhơ raxal. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Ting kơi ơi praaq, Ađó ơi n'niên nôôq he tavaaih palơq paraaq ưng paraaq dhalam, đóng nôôq he nek mưi rau pale tââp bóóng kalóóng nôôq rau tavaaih ưng Ađó. <verse eid="JAS 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Nhan móón adhi anó tanhơr ưng aku, phaai n'nal kơi ađô: Dyóp ngaai phaai đâh xâng, jih praaq, jih grâ. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Taai garâ jar-ââih ưng akóón manưih kah têêng vaaih rau bhơt liêm ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Taai kơi achêk, lơh xók ơi lôh m'peq dyóp rau anhuq palơq n'nal mơ rau môôp lơt, Phaai pei đơơp dhiq rau moor dha-iiq paraaq bâân choh chóói, nek paraaq ve chóóm paq jóói ravaai adhi anó. <verse eid="JAS 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Phaai val kơi nôôq manưih ting têêng kơi paraaq, óóq chapiên nek nôôq manưih xâng hơq bhlơp galơơk chênh ađêi. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Ơi la ngaai manưih nek manưih xâng paraaq hơq eh rau nek manưih ting têêng, nek manưih achêk thê kơi mưi chanak manưih ngil haliq mat kaxu ưng ađêi kalóóng xamil. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Manưih achêk ơi ngil ađêi hayơq yuur xooq, n'drươh hơq havil vaq ađêi biêh ng'kơi vaq. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Bơơi ngaai chamet kanóq leq gani dyóp liêm ưng rau rathaai, lơq bhiêk tabhlơng têêng kơi ađek, kah val kơi manưih xâng buôn havil, hơq nek manưih têêng rau kiêng têêng, hơq manưih ađek e bâân phươk kalóóng tarnêêng têêng ưng ađêi. <verse eid="JAS 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />La ngaai kanóq ađêi nek huuiq taruuih liêm, hơq kah jư n'taak ađêi, bơơi bhiêk bhlơp chachââr lóóm ađêi, nek taruuih liêm ưng manưih achêk kah rau malơơi. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Taruuih liêm sek tabah lơq yươq madham anhuq toom mat Yaang Pleng, Ama nôôq he, ađek nek poor jóói paniên dharit, kamaai atươp dhiq garnhuh bhrê hư ưng piđó, lơq jư ađêi yươq anhuq tââq manưih hóng katiêk.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Nhan móón adhi anó ưng aku, óóq jư lóóm huuiq dhiq Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih cha-iil tabah, palơq rau mahóng malóóm. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Ơi parja mưi manưih póón panóón vaang palơq kun aau liêm kra mót kalóóng đong gươl ưng adhi anó, hơq mưi chanak manưih ngeeo palơq kun aau tagêi ramang kung mót dyơq, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />bơơi adhi anó chamet lêi leq manưih xơp n'đóh kun aau liêm kra lơq móón: “Nhan abhươp tơơt dhiq tanơơt charnap ađô!”, lơq palơq manưih ngeeo, adhi anó móón “Amei dyương dhiq tôôh!”, môôiq “Phaai tơơt tóór jaruh dyung aku!”, <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />hơq eh dhơq adhi anó ơi pantua tơơt praaq dhiq m'pơng chênh nôôq adhi anó lơq xar kơi manưih praaq xêi xanêi palơq nôôq karnóq môôp lơt kơi? <verse eid="JAS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Nhan móón adhi anó bơk nh'nhơr ưng aku, phaai tameng xâng: Eh dhơq Yaang Pleng ơi chââih manưih ngeeo ha-ul kalóóng manưih hóng katiêk đóng xar kơi manưih karvaan kabhôôq kalóóng lóóm huuiq lơq manưih bâân đơơp katiêk karuung đu Ađó ơi hươq palơq ngaai nôôq nh'nhơr Ađó kơi? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Kơi ađek hơq adhi anó ơi praaq tamôôp manưih ngeeo! Eh dhơq manưih karvaan buôn chanaaq janah adhi anó lơq piđó buôn galôôi adhi anó leq đong xêi xanêi kơi? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Eh dhơq piđó buôn praaq tamôôp achak bhi chap ơi bâân tabóq leq adhi anó kơi? <verse eid="JAS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Dhơ kơi ađek, la adhi anó têêng liêm dyóp gani ưng Bhua ting kơi Bha-aar Paraaq Yaang Pleng: “Phaai nh'nhơr ayô manưih dharing tapóóng ađêi pakơi chênh achak ađêi kala”, nek adhi anó têêng dhalam. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Bơơi la adhi anó mahóng malóóm, hơq adhi anó têêng lơt, lơq bâân gani móón lơt kơi manưih têêng lơt gani. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Ơi ngaai manưih ve chóóm huuiq jư tabhơt gani? Lơh tââq n'đóih kalơm dhiq mưi rau, hơq manưih achêk val xar manưih têêng lơt bhơt gani. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Taai Yaang ơi praaq: “Óóq têêng tapiing!”, kung ơi praaq: “Óóq leng manưih!” Bơơi la adhi anó yươq têêng tapiing, hơq val leng manưih, nek adhi anó val xar manưih têêng lơt gani. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Kơi ađek hayơq phaai papraaq lơq têêng vôôiq kơi nôôq manưih e bâân praaq xêi tââq gani ưng rau rathaai. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Ơi rau praaq xêi kah ayô ka-er manưih kah pakah lóóm ayô ka-er. Lóóm ayô ka-er pajơơr jalơh rau praaq xêi!<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Nhan móón adhi anó ưng aku, ve rau malơơi la ngaai ađek móón ađêi ve lóóm huuiq bơơi val kah ve tarnêêng têêng? Lóóm huuiq achêk kah chóóm paq manưih achêk, kah lua? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Babi mưi adhi anó môôiq mamóóq adhi chapiên kah ve kun aau lơq tabhuch tapiêl chana padyơk dyóp tangêi, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />bơơi mưi chanak manưih kalóóng adhi anó móón palơq piđó: “Phaai vôôiq kalóóng yươq rauha, phaai jư đóng ngan lơq cha đóng kabhôôq!”, hơq adhi anó kah đóng piđó nôôq rau achak araang kiêng đươi, hơq ve rau malơơi malaai? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Lóóm huuiq kung kơi ađek, la kah ve tarnêêng têêng nek chênh ađó chêt. <verse eid="JAS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Dhơ kơi ađek, ngaai ađek e móón: “Amei ve lóóm huuiq, hayơq aku ve tarnêêng têêng.” Nek đóng aku lêi lóóm huuiq kah ve tarnêêng têêng ưng amei, hayơq aku e đóng amei lêi lóóm huuiq palơq tarnêêng têêng ưng aku. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Amei huuiq kơi Yaang Pleng nek mưi giêl; Amei huuiq dhalam. Abhưi kung huuiq lơq piđó hayer kakhin. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Nô manưih ngôôk abhôh, amei kiêng n'nal kơi lóóm huuiq kah ve tarnêêng têêng nek kah malơơi kah? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Eh dhơq Ap-ra-haam, abhươp avuôq nôôq he, ơi bâân đóók bhơt liêm palơq tarnêêng têêng xók ađó tapôông I-saak, akóón padruuih ađêi, dhiq baang bhanuôih kơi? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Amei lêi kơi lóóm huuiq makơi palơq tarnêêng têêng ưng amei, lơq ve tarnêêng têêng, lóóm huuiq ơi bâân liêm kre. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Paraaq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng ađô ơi bâân jaap paraaq, kơi ađô: “Ap-ra-haam huuiq Yaang Pleng, rau ađek bâân đóók nek bhơt liêm đóng ađó,” Lơq ađó bâân đóók nek parjơơk ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Adhi anó lêi nek, mưi chanak bâân đóók bhơt liêm palơq tarnêêng têêng, lơq kah chapiên tââq lóóm huuiq hơq giêl. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Kung makơi kơi ađek, eh dhơq pađiil baan achak Ra-haap bâân đóók bhơt liêm palơq tarnêêng têêng xók pơh yaauq nôôq manưih đââng paraaq lơq đââng piđó vôôiq hót kalơng lââng kơi? <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Ơi kơi achak kah ve ravaai nek chêt ng'kơi, lóóm huuiq kah ve tarnêêng têêng nek kung chêt kơi achêk.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Nhan móón adhi anó ưng aku, óóq ve bơk ngaai kalóóng adhi anó têêng thêi, ơi n'nal kơi nôôq he e phaai pei đơơp rau praaq xêi gamak lơh. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Taai nôôq he maar têêng lơt kalóóng bơk kơi. La ngaai manưih kah têêng lơt kalóóng bóóp praaq, hơq ađek nek manưih bhơt liêm, ve đuôh têêng kala bhơt plok achak. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />La nôôq he tabóq janoom leq buum axeh đóng têêng piđó bâân xâng bóóp kơi nôôq he, hơq nôôq he keh đââng tabhơt achak ưng ađó. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Kung phaai lêi nôôq jatau ve dhanang gamak garóóq lơq bâân adhiiq karơ dhalươq kajêêq, bơơi dyóp beq jatau bâân kađââng yua tââq mưi benh gaai tagah katưưiq đóng tơk dhiq hơq tarnêêng ưng manưih gaai jatau kiêng vôôiq. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Makơi kơi achêk, n'taak nek mưi rau katưưiq bơơi val pajơơr nôôq tarnêêng gamak. Phaai lêi mưi par-aang óih katưưiq n'đó kơi óch róh mưi parah booiq gamak ng'kơi! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />N'taak kung thê kơi óih, mưi talaang katiêk kah dhalam. N'taak bâân patơơt dhiq m'pơng nôôq kalóóng achak araang ưng nôôq he, têêng anhuq tabhơt achak lơq óch róh tabhơt klaang đơơi, hơq chênh ađó nek bâân óch róh kalóóng maraaih. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Dyóp rau adhah booiq, lơq achim adyóór, agung adyeeng lơq kadhóóng adhah taxiiq maar đuôh têêng kala lơq ơi bâân akóón manưih têêng kala. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Bơơi kah ngaai ve chóóm têêng kala dhiq n'taak, mưi rau têêng aak kah dhêi têêng panhôôn, bing chapââr tiêng chêt đok. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Palơq ađó nôôq he babóóch bhi haanh Chuôq lơq Ama, kung palơq ađó, nôôq he tóh karuuh akóón manưih, nek dhong nooi ơi bâân tavaaih ting kơi a-ô ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Paraaq babóóch haanh lơq paraaq tóh karuuh gluh vaaih tââq kung mưi beq bóóp. Nhan móón adhi anó ưng aku, nôôq tarnêêng kơi ađek kah chóóm yuur vaaih. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Mưi paloong tóm tââq kung mưi tóm dhơl kah chóóm hóói gluh đơơk baq palơq miq đơơk atang kah alua? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Nhan móón adhi anó ưng aku, tââm tarung kah chóóm gluh bóóng pale ô-liiu? Môôiq tââm nho bóóng pale tarung, kah alua? Đơơk kariêq kung kah chóóm đóng gluh đơơk baq.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Ngaai manưih tabech galang lơq dyóp n'nal dhiq m'pơng adhi anó? Manưih achêk phaai pakah nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng ađêi vaaih gluh tââq charnap mamông liêm kra kalóóng lóóm karnóq pakatưưiq ưng rau tabech galang. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Bơơi la adhi anó ve lóóm makhinh ahaaq atang lơq n'thaam malóóch kalóóng lóóm ađêi, hơq óóq parlaach pajơơr lơq praaq galơơk chachââr tarjơl palơq paraaq dhalam. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Ađô eh rau nek rau tabech galang dhaluônh leq tââq m'piing, bơơi nek rau chô leq hóng katiêk, manưih ti, abhưi abhóch. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Taai rau kađiq makhinh lơq n'thaam malóóch dhiq tơơt, hơq rau nhôôn nhaauq lơq dyóp tarnêêng môôp lơt tơơt dhiq ađek. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Palâh lóóiq, rau tabech galang tââq pleng laloom tââm nek sek tabah, tatun ađek nek malóóch kiêng tangêi bhuui khe yươq tarvei tarlak, moor dha-iiq, lóóm karnóq tarxâng bóóp, bing lóóm a-yô lơq nôôq pô pale liêm kra, kah paang-ra tadhơ lóóm, kah galơơk chachââr. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Pô pale ưng rau bhơt liêm bâân chêh kalóóng tangêi bhuui khe tââq nôôq manưih têêng tavaaih tangêi bhuui khe.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Nôôq ganơt tarkaai tarlak bhral tââq n'đó dhiq lơq nôôq rau tarjeng tarvei gluh vaaih n'tââq m'pơng adhi anó? Eh dhơq piđó gluh vaaih tââq nôôq lóóm malóóch ưng adhi anó, nek rau bhiêk dyơq tarjeng tarvei m'pơng nôôq achak araang ưng adhi anó kơi? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Adhi anó malóóch kiêng hơq kah ve bâân, adhi anó leng manưih. Adhi anó n'thaam malóóch, hơq kah kơi chóóm bâân, adhi anó tarjeng lơq tarleng. Adhi anó kah ve taai adhi anó kah nhan. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Adhi anó nhan hơq kah bâân đơơp taai adhi anó nhan kơi rau lơt, lơơi ramuôh đóng nôôq lóóm malóóch n'thaam ưng ađêi. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Nôôq manưih têêng tapiing tôôh! Adhi anó kah n'nal kơi tarnêêng têêng parjơơk palơq manưih hóng katiêk nek brau tarjơl palơq Yaang Pleng kơi? Hayơq, la ngaai kiêng têêng parjơơk palơq manưih hóng katiêk, nek manưih ađek bâân patơơt dhiq tanơơt manưih brau ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Môôiq adhi anó ngóq kơi Bha-aar Paraaq Yaang Pleng praaq kah malơơi: “Yaang Liêm đu Ađó têêng mamông kalóóng nôôq he, Yaang achêk kiêng nh'nhơr nôôq he patơk mơ tatrô”? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Ađó đââng đóng ơơn phươk liêm gamak lơh, hayơq Bha-aar Paraaq Yaang Pleng móón: “Yaang Pleng jaklâk lóóiq manưih praaq laach, bơơi Ađó đóng ơơn phươk liêm leq manưih pa-êêp lóóm.” <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Taai kơi ađek, phaai huuiq xâng bóóp Yaang Pleng. Bơơi phaai jaklâk abhưi abhóch, hayơq ađó e viêr changaai tââq adhi anó. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Phaai tơk pađan Yaang Pleng, lơq Ađó e tơk đan adhi anó. Nôôq manưih têêng lơt, phaai têêng pasek têi ađêi; nôôq ngaai bơơr lóóm, phaai kajut pasek lóóm ađêi. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Phaai ranguôq luônh lóóm, nhiim kalau lơq xaxih kagôh! Phaai raxal dhariêng kachang ưng adhi anó xar dhariêng nhiim, lơq raxal bhuui bhe vaaih ranguôq rabaang. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Phaai tư pa-êêp ađêi toom mat Chuôq, hayơq Ađó e tơq adhi anó yuur.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Nhan móón adhi anó, óóq praaq tamôôp xóng ađêi. Manưih praaq tamôôp adhi anó môôiq praaq xêi adhi anó ađêi nek praaq tamôôp gani lơq praaq xêi lơt gani. Bơơi la amei xêi lơt gani hơq amei eh rau nek manưih ting huuiq đuui gani, hơq nek manưih xêi xanêi. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Yaang đóng gani lơq xêi lơt nek mưi giêl, nek Yaang têêng kala paq jóói lơq leng kaxiêt. Hayơq amei nek ngaai, manưih xêi matu lơt manưih dharing tapóóng ađêi?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Xók ađôk, phaai xâng nô, nôôq manưih xók praaq kơi ađô: “Vaar ađôk hamôôiq tangêi rayiiu nôôq yi nek vôôiq tơk kanóón tôôh, hayơq e têêng tarnêêng dhiq ađek mưi kamó, buôn baan lơq bâân kavaan.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Nek nôôq manưih kah bâân n'nal chiên tangêi rayiiu, parmông ưng adhi anó nek hau rau? Taai adhi anó nek huôl đơơk avaaih kalóóng maxưưiq hayơq bâân huôl bil tich. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Klóóih dhiq ađek, adhi anó phaai móón: “La Chuôq kiêng, hơq nôôq yi e mamông lơq e têêng tarnêêng ađô hamôôiq tarnêêng tôôh.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Bơơi, adhi anó xók ađôk dyơq parlaach dhiq karnóq pakah pajơơr ưng ađêi. Dyóp tarnêêng pajơơr kơi ađek nek môôp lơt. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Hayơq, ngaai manưih n'nal rau liêm kiêng têêng hơq val kah têêng, hơq manưih achêk ve matu lơt.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Hayơq bhêêl ađô, phaai chamet lêi nô, nôôq manưih karvaan tôôh, phaai nhiim griit lơq dhaloong lalơu taai rau jarnah xaryô ưng nôôq pe xók bhral. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Drươp karvaan nôôq pe bâân khung kluuiq, hayơq kun aau nôôq pe val xar chana đóng kóót kamuôr. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Vaang lơq baak ưng nôôq pe bâân laq parhóm, lơq rau ateet aróóq ưng piđó e nek karnal jaklâk lóóiq nôôq pe, lơq ađó e cha lâân achak araang nôôq pe thê kơi óih. Nôôq pe ơi kaboq karong drươp karvaan ađêi kalóóng nôôq tangêi tatun xariêq. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Phaai lêi tôôh, jêên makông ưng nôôq manưih têêng makông, hơq nek nôôq manưih chaxóót dhiq nôôq kalung klung ưng nôôq pe, jêên achêk ơi bâân kadhâng lóóiq dhiq nôôq pe, ađó dyơq yuur dhaloong lalơu, lơq nôôq dhariêng nhiim kalau ưng nôôq manưih chaxóót achêk ơi tơk hót katór Chuôq nôôq kabhuh linh. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Nôôq pe ơi mamông laq lôh lơq rathaai dhiq katiêk. Nôôq pe ơi paramaq lóóm ađêi đóng tangêi leng adhah. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Nôôq pe ơi patu lơq leng chêt manưih bhơt liêm, manưih achêk kah jaklâk jơl lóóiq nôôq pe.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Taai kơi ađek, nhan móón adhi anó, phaai raan jruôn patơk xók Chuôq bhral. Lêi tôôh, manưih têêng hare đương lêi pô pale kiiq bhlơng tââq katiêk, raan jruôn đương lêi ađó patơk bhêêl katiêk bâân đơơp bó tanââp nil lơq parluch nil. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Adhi anó kung phaai đơơp jruôn. Phaai têêng đóng mưng lóóm ađêi taai rau tơk tabhral ưng Chuôq ơi ađan. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Adhi anó ơơi, óóq ta-uôr jaklâk jơl xóng ađêi, đóng adhi anó óóq bâân xêi lơt. Lêi tôôh, Takóh Praaq Xêi dyơq dyương dhiq palóng. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Nhan móón adhi anó, phaai ngil xamil leq rau đơơp jarnah lơq đơơp jruôn ưng nôôq manưih đââng paraaq Yaang Pleng, nôôq manưih vơn achak Chuôq truuih pachóóm. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Lêi nô, nôôq he đóók nôôq manưih mưng karnóq nek “ve phươk”. Adhi anó ơi xâng leq praan đuôh đơơp jruôn ưng Joop, lơq adhi anó ơi lêi karnóq kiêng ưng Chuôq, taai Chuôq kavaan lóóm ayô ka-er, lơq lóóm dha-iiq.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Bơơi, laloom tââm, nhan móón adhi anó ưng aku, óóq ng'kóh, kung óóq chaleq pleng hamôôiq chaleq katiêk môôiq dhơ dharau paraaq ng'kóh rau lââng. Bơơi, “ve” hơq phaai nek móón “ve”, lơq “kah” nek móón “kah”, đóng adhi anó óóq bâân jaluq mót dhiq praaq xêi matu lơt.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Ngaai manưih kalóóng adhi anó dyơq đơơp jarnah kơi? Manưih achêk phaai gavơh nhan. Ve ngaai bhuui marhaal kơi? Manưih achêk phaai babóóch haanh. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Ngaai manưih kalóóng adhi anó dhuôr ka-ai kơi? Manưih achêk phaai kayua nôôq takóh taha kalóóng akóón dhơn Chuôq vôôiq lơq kalóóng achak ưng Chuôq, piđó phaai gavơh nhan klóóih đóng ađó, xut dhơu đóng ađó. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Paraaq gavơh nhan ưng lóóm huuiq e paq jóói manưih dhuôr ka-ai lơq Chuôq e tơq manưih achêk yuur. La manưih ađô ve kơi ơi têêng lơt, hơq manưih achêk e bâân lơơi lơt. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Kơi achêk, phaai truuih matu lơt palơq xóng ađêi lơq gavơh nhan đóng xóng ađêi đóng adhi anó ve chóóm bâân payươh. Paraaq gavơh nhan ưng manưih bhơt liêm xók bâân têêng vôôiq hơq lóng tiêng bhlơng. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Ê-li nek mưi akóón manưih đơơp lóóm karnóq bhuui ranguôq dhiêp kơi nôôq he. Lơq ađó gavơh nhan palơq kơi bhơt lóóm nhan đóng pleng óóq bó, hơq pleng kah bó kalóóng xưưq bhluuch pe kamó chapat kaxe. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Hayơq Ê-li val gavơh nhan, hơq pleng n'toh bó, lơq katiêk avaaih chanoh chabet.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Nhan móón adhi anó ưng aku, la ngaai manưih kalóóng adhi anó vôôiq xraang tââq paraaq dhalam, lơq ve ngaai ađek đââng manưih achêk val chô, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />nek phaai n'nal kơi ngaai palâh charhóóng manưih ve matu lơt gluh tââq kalơng lơt xraang ưng ađó, manưih ađek e trôông paq ravaai manưih achêk tââq akan chêt, lơq nek pađơp buur bơk rau matu lơt.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>